# What a failed comparison leaves behind: the render that did not match, the pixel diff,
# and the reference `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1` replaced. Working files — the CI workflow
# uploads the directory as an artifact so they can be looked at, and none of them belongs
# in the repository. Without this, one `git add -A` after a red run commits them.
*.new.png
*.diff.png
*.old.png
